---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+17035550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(703) 555-0199';
---
<Layout>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="hero-badge">● WOODBRIDGE &amp; PRINCE WILLIAM COUNTY · SAME-DAY SERVICE</div>
        <h1>GUTTER<br />SPECIALISTS IN <span>WOODBRIDGE</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">Clean. Repair. Protect. Same-Day Service.</p>
        <p class="hero-desc">When clogged or damaged gutters threaten your Woodbridge home, every storm counts. Our licensed crew delivers expert cleaning, repairs, and seamless installations with upfront pricing and workmanship backed by a written guarantee across Prince William County.</p>
        <div class="hero-tags">
          <span class="hero-tag">⏱ Same-Day Response</span>
          <span class="hero-tag">🛡 Licensed &amp; Insured</span>
          <span class="hero-tag">✓ Upfront Pricing</span>
          <span class="hero-tag">🏠 Free Estimates</span>
          <span class="hero-tag">🛡 Workmanship Guarantee</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-ctas">
          <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Schedule an Appointment</a>
          <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-outline">Get a Free Quote</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual">
        <div class="hero-card">
          <div class="hero-card-icon">🧹</div>
          <h3>Clogged Gutters?</h3>
          <p>We clean, repair, and install seamless gutters and guards the same day in most cases for Woodbridge homes.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why Us -->
  <section class="section section-alt" id="why">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Why Woodbridge Homeowners <span>Choose Us</span></h2>
        <p>Virginia weather — heavy rain, falling leaves, and occasional ice — puts constant stress on gutters. You need a local specialist who responds the same day and does the job right the first time.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">⚡</div>
          <h3>Same-Day Cleaning &amp; Repair</h3>
          <p>Most same-day gutter calls in Woodbridge are completed within hours of your call — no multi-day waits.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">📜</div>
          <h3>Licensed &amp; Insured</h3>
          <p>Every crew member is licensed, insured, and experienced with seamless aluminum, steel, and copper systems common in Northern Virginia.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">💵</div>
          <h3>Upfront Pricing, Zero Surprises</h3>
          <p>We quote before we start. No hidden fees, no upsell pressure — just honest gutter work at fair local rates.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">📍</div>
          <h3>Local to Woodbridge</h3>
          <p>Based at 930 Highams Ct — we know Prince William County housing, oak and maple leaf loads, and the drainage challenges of local neighborhoods.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="stats-row">
        <div class="stat-item"><strong>15+</strong><span>Years Experience</span></div>
        <div class="stat-item"><strong>2,500+</strong><span>Homes Served</span></div>
        <div class="stat-item"><strong>4.9★</strong><span>Average Rating</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Problems preview -->
  <section class="section" id="problems">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Recognize <span>These Signs?</span></h2>
        <p>Leaves, debris, and age take a toll on Woodbridge gutters. If your system shows any of these symptoms, don’t wait for the next storm.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="problems-grid">
        <a href="/problems/clogged-gutters/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-urgent">Urgent</span>
          <h3>Clogged Gutters</h3>
          <p>Overflowing during rain means blocked downspouts or heavy debris. Same-day cleaning restores proper flow.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/problems/leaking-gutters/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-urgent">Urgent</span>
          <h3>Leaking Gutters</h3>
          <p>Water dripping from seams or joints signals holes, loose hangers, or failed sealant. Act before foundation damage.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/problems/sagging-gutters/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-soon">Address Soon</span>
          <h3>Sagging Gutters</h3>
          <p>Pulling away from the fascia usually means failed hangers or overloaded sections. Quick re-hanging prevents bigger repairs.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/problems/overflowing-gutters/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-soon">Address Soon</span>
          <h3>Overflowing Gutters</h3>
          <p>Water cascading over the edge points to clogs, undersized gutters, or improper pitch.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/problems/damaged-downspouts/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-urgent">Urgent</span>
          <h3>Damaged Downspouts</h3>
          <p>Crushed, disconnected, or missing downspouts dump water at the foundation. Fast replacement protects your home.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/problems/ice-dams/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-soon">Address Soon</span>
          <h3>Ice Dams</h3>
          <p>Winter ice buildup can lift gutters and force water under shingles. Prevention and proper drainage help.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Services preview -->
  <section class="section section-alt" id="services">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Expert Gutter <span>Services</span></h2>
        <p>Every gutter problem has a clear solution. Our crew diagnoses accurately and completes the work correctly.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="services-grid">
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="service-label">Most Requested</span>
          <h3>Gutter Cleaning</h3>
          <p>Thorough removal of leaves, needles, and debris so water flows freely and your foundation stays protected.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Full system cleaning</li>
            <li>Downspout flush</li>
            <li>From $149</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/gutter-cleaning/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="service-label">Common Fix</span>
          <h3>Gutter Repair</h3>
          <p>Fix leaks, sagging sections, and damaged hangers. We restore function without unnecessary full replacements.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Seam &amp; joint sealing</li>
            <li>Hanger replacement</li>
            <li>From $99</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/gutter-repair/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="service-label">New Systems</span>
          <h3>Seamless Installation</h3>
          <p>Custom-fit seamless aluminum and steel gutter systems built for Virginia weather and lasting curb appeal.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Custom sizing &amp; color</li>
            <li>Professional install</li>
            <li>Custom quote</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/gutter-installation/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="service-label">Protection</span>
          <h3>Gutter Guards</h3>
          <p>Keep leaves and debris out year-round with micro-mesh or screen guards designed for Northern Virginia trees.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Micro-mesh options</li>
            <li>Reduced cleaning</li>
            <li>Warranty available</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/gutter-guards/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="service-label">Urgent</span>
          <h3>Emergency Gutter Repair</h3>
          <p>Storm damage, collapsed sections, or active leaks — we respond fast to protect your home.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Storm response</li>
            <li>Temporary securing</li>
            <li>Same-day when possible</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/emergency-gutter-repair/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="service-label">Drainage</span>
          <h3>Downspout Services</h3>
          <p>Repair, extend, or replace downspouts so water is carried safely away from the foundation.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Extensions &amp; elbows</li>
            <li>Underground drains</li>
            <li>Proper discharge</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/downspout-services/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Process -->
  <section class="section" id="process">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>How We Protect <span>Your Home</span></h2>
        <p>Every Woodbridge gutter job follows a clear, transparent process.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="process-steps">
        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="step-num">01</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Call or Request a Quote</h3>
            <p>Tell us about your gutters. We schedule quickly — often same-day or next-day slots — and arrive prepared.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="step-num">02</div>
          <div>
            <h3>On-Site Inspection</h3>
            <p>We check pitch, hangers, seams, downspouts, and fascia condition. Problems are identified clearly, not assumed.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="step-num">03</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Honest Estimate</h3>
            <p>Before any work begins you receive a straightforward written quote. Approve or decline — your decision.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="step-num">04</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Professional Work</h3>
            <p>With your approval the crew gets to work. We carry common parts and materials so most jobs finish on the first visit.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="step-num">05</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Final Check &amp; Cleanup</h3>
            <p>We verify water flow, secure all fasteners, and leave your property cleaner than we found it.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Location -->
  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Find Us in <span>Woodbridge, VA</span></h2>
        <p>Proudly serving Woodbridge and all of Prince William County from Highams Court.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="content-block" style="text-align:center">
        <p><strong>📍 930 Highams Ct, Woodbridge, VA 22191</strong></p>
        <p>Serving Woodbridge · Dale City · Lake Ridge · Occoquan · Lorton · Manassas · and surrounding communities.</p>
        <div class="map-wrapper" style="height:380px;margin:1.5rem auto;max-width:800px">
          <iframe title="Woodbridge location map" src="https://www.openstreetmap.org/export/embed.html?bbox=-77.2697%2C38.6382%2C-77.2297%2C38.6782&amp;layer=mapnik&amp;marker=38.6582%2C-77.2497" loading="lazy" style="width:100%;height:100%;border:0"></iframe>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta-banner">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Gutters Overwhelmed in Woodbridge?</h2>
      <p>Don’t risk foundation damage or stained siding. If your gutters are clogged, leaking, or damaged — our team can respond today.</p>
      <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call Now — {phoneDisplay}</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Gutter Questions <span>Answered</span></h2>
        <p>Real answers to what Woodbridge homeowners ask most.</p>
      </div>
      <h2>How often should I have my gutters cleaned in Woodbridge?</h2>
      <p>Most homes with mature trees benefit from cleaning twice a year — spring and fall. Heavy oak and maple areas may need three cleanings. We can recommend a schedule after inspecting your property.</p>
      <h2>How much does gutter cleaning cost in Woodbridge?</h2>
      <p>Typical single-story cleaning starts around $149–$249 depending on linear footage and accessibility. We provide a clear quote before work begins.</p>
      <h2>Do you install seamless gutters?</h2>
      <p>Yes. We fabricate and install seamless aluminum systems in popular colors, sized correctly for your roof and local rainfall intensity.</p>
      <h2>Are you licensed and insured in Virginia?</h2>
      <p>Yes. All work is performed by licensed, insured technicians familiar with Northern Virginia building practices and local conditions.</p>
      <h2>Should I repair or replace my gutters?</h2>
      <p>Repair usually makes sense when sections are sound and issues are localized. Full replacement is better for extensively corroded, undersized, or repeatedly failing systems. We give an honest assessment either way.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
